<title>HONG KONG: Sime Darby HK year net down 47.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Sime Darby HK year net down 47.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   57.1	vs 108.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    25.0	vs 86.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  57.3 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    266.0     vs 504.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		     7,339.0   vs 7,159.0</p>
<p>    Company name		 Sime Darby Hong Kong Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 24-31</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 8</p>
<p>NOTE - A distributor of motor vehicles and heavy equipment.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on sale of a leasehold property.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 37 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 12 cents) vs 106 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
